  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0dlliqm.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HZFXtcG2Ty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/804423500580388905?label=&amp;color=7096aa&amp;labelColor=55778c&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=7096aa&amp;style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/uraneptus2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/uraneptus2?label=&amp;color=7096aa&amp;labelColor=55778c&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;logoColor=7096aa&amp;style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/410500.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/410500.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\"></span></p><h2>📖關於本模組：</h2><h4>這個模組在Minecraft中加入了一種冰凍豬。這種豬與普通豬非常相似，會掉落冷凍豬排，可解凍成普通豬排。</h4><h4>火焰附加效果也能解凍冷凍豬排。</h4><h4>煙燻爐能直接將冷凍肉轉變為熟肉版本</h4><h4>你可以在所有冰原/雪地生態域中找到這種豬。</h4><h4>當普通豬在細雪中停留300刻（類似原版中骷髏變成流浪者的機制），就會轉變為雪豬</h4><h4>當雪豬被流浪者或任何帶有<em>killer_for_snowpig_disc</em>標籤的生物殺死時，會掉落由<span>Luz</span><span>#8017</span>創作的定制音樂唱片</h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4>你也可以在這裡收聽這首歌曲：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vDBh9JsE0Hw\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fluuuzzdj%252fluz-frosty-snig-snow-pig-soundtrack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soundcloud</a></h4>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>注意：本模組的1.12.2和1.15.2版本已不再支援！如果有人想要反向移植這個模組，請通過Discord：Uraneptus#5442或Twitter與我聯繫</h4><h4>&nbsp;你可以在<strong>這裡</strong>找到<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">fabric版本！</a></h4><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\"></p><h2>👾錯誤回報：</h2><h4>如果你能通過問題頁面向我回報錯誤，將會對我很有幫助</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\"></p><h2>🎲 可選模組兼容性：</h2><h4>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事 (Farmer's Delight)</a></h4><h4>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組目錄 (Catalogue)</a></h4><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\"></p>",
